\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Your profile suggests a leader who is 
\f1\b generally ethical, humble, and empathic, while still being quite strategic and willing to use influence deliberately
\f0\b0 . The main development opportunity is not \'93becoming less dark\'94; it is making sure your strategic instincts remain transparent, collaborative, and aligned with your values\'97especially under pressure.\
One important caveat: without the questionnaire's scoring method, norms, items, and cutoff definitions, these numbers should be treated as 
\f1\b directional self-reflection rather than clinical or definitive personality measures
\f0\b0 . A score of 57 on one instrument can mean something quite different on another.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

